  "body": {
    "title": "Git helper aborted case, readGit signal and refresh tool signal passing",
    "summary": "Add the aborted case to fail(), the optional signal to readGit, pass deps.signal explicitly in git_fetch, git_fetch_refs, git_rev_parse, git_symbolic_ref, git_ls_tree and git_show (checked between its three commands), and add the lowerable timeoutMs (1 to 30000) to git_cat_file.",
    "size": "M",
    "order": 3,
    "acceptanceChecks": [
      "Each refresh tool returns a rejected failure on an aborted signal and starts no later command",
      "Successive calls sharing one deadline signal stop at the deadline and later calls never spawn",
      "git_cat_file timeoutMs accepts 1 to 30000 and keeps today's default and messages"
    ],
